<tr id="S2.T1.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S2.T1.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">BERT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">34</a>]</cite>: masked token prediction</th>
<td id="S2.T1.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Text</td>
<td id="S2.T1.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Masked text</td></tr>
<tr id="S2.T1.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S2.T1.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Vision-language model CLIP <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib116" title="" class="ltx_ref">116</a>]</cite></th>
