<td id="S2.T1.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">A nearest neighbor of <math id="S2.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>X</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="S2.T1.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
