<th id="S2.T1.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">GPT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib117" title="" class="ltx_ref">117</a>]</cite>: next token prediction</th>
